<Base
  title="The Revenue Ops Blind Spot: When Process Becomes Paralysis | Urban Gavelin"
  description="Revenue Operations was supposed to streamline sales. For many B2B companies it has done the opposite, burying execution under layers of compliance and turning process into a roadblock."
